n8.延長公開收購期間之理由:\n本次公開收購以取得公平交易委員會不禁止台信電訊與精誠資訊結合之決定為成就\n條件之一，惟截至本公告日止，公平交易委員會仍在審查中。\n9.其他應敘明事項:\n台信電訊於115年9月29日依法向金融監督管理委員會申報延長公開收購期間30日。\n經延長後，本次公開收購期間屆滿日將至115年11月5日止。另本次公開收購案之其\n他條件維持不變，公開收購對價仍預定於延長期間屆滿日次日起算五個營業日(含\n第五個營業日)以內撥付。"}],"peers":[{"code":"2412","name":"中華電","close":146.0,"market_cap":1132587195570.0,"pe":28.68,"pb":3.09,"dividend_yield":3.56,"ttm_eps":5.1,"gross_margin":37.54,"revenue_yoy":null,"revenue_cum_yoy":null,"chg_60d":7.6,"self":false},{"code":"2345","name":"智邦","close":1965.0,"market_cap":1102596667605.0,"pe":30.87,"pb":15.91,"dividend_yield":0.76,"ttm_eps":63.65,"gross_margin":19.7,"revenue_yoy":null,"revenue_cum_yoy":null,"chg_60d":-19.3,"self":false},{"code":"3045","name":"台灣大","close":122.0,"market_cap":454258583830.0,"pe":23.06,"pb":4.42,"dividend_yield":3.89,"ttm_eps":5.33,"gross_margin":22.16,"revenue_yoy":null,"revenue_cum_yoy":null,"chg_60d":9.3,"self":true},{"code":"4904","name":"遠傳","close":106.0,"market_cap":382416767842.0,"pe":25.79,"pb":4.44,"dividend_yield":3.59,"ttm_eps":4.12,"gross_margin":31.71,"revenue_yoy":null,"revenue_cum_yoy":null,"chg_60d":6.9,"self":false},{"code":"3081","name":"聯亞","close":2925.0,"market_cap":297966836700.0,"pe":null,"pb":null,"dividend_yield":null,"ttm_eps":null,"gross_margin":null,"revenue_yoy":null,"revenue_cum_yoy":null,"chg_60d":69.2,"self":false},{"code":"6442","name":"光聖","close":1625.0,"market_cap":132953522000.0,"pe":48.08,"pb":9.76,"dividend_yield":0.69,"ttm_eps":35.68,"gross_margin":62.51,"revenue_yoy":null,"revenue_cum_yoy":null,"chg_60d":6.4,"self":false},{"code":"6285","name":"啟碁","close":238.0,"market_cap":115059043442.0,"pe":26.07,"pb":3.21,"dividend_yield":1.81,"ttm_eps":9.21,"gross_margin":13.0,"revenue_yoy":null,"revenue_cum_yoy":null,"chg_60d":-2.3,"self":false},{"code":"2455","name":"全新","close":580.0,"market_cap":108450396940.0,"pe":142.16,"pb":29.37,"dividend_yield":0.45,"ttm_eps":4.12,"gross_margin":38.61,"revenue_yoy":null,"revenue_cum_yoy":null,"chg_60d":82.1,"self":false}],"c